+# CI gate policy
+
+The AI review gate runs on pull requests and reviews only the diff.
+
+Initial actions:
+
+- block: high-confidence, high-severity findings
+- warn: useful findings that should not stop the merge
+- report: low-confidence observations kept for calibration
